{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not ignore failed MDC restoration on inline executors.** The result is already completed when `restore.close()` throws, so this catch suppresses an ordinary restoration failure. A direct executor returns with the caller\u2019s MDC erased or plugin fields leaked. Retry or propagate restoration before publishing the result, and assert the caller\u2019s complete MDC map after an injected failure.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77JRHR","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":278,"observation_digest":"5052c5733ef33e246014c6759635c0bc9b9c2ea3aaaf0eb958220ef0326ce317","observation_id":"aro_v1_kbjmk4z66m7ciyauyz2zmnoaxs","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:49:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ypy2y57vtva3tue6ol67lga5xg","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2cc073779905eb2b61db09fe0e50e867759edd7a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":274,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_tkotwjwiwuzdrdrec5tov33bg7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:49:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
